  "question": {
    "text": "The momentum of a body is increased by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></math>. The percentage increase in the kinetic energy of the body is_<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>%</mo><mo>.</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "125",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The relation of kinetic energy and momentum is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>The new value of momentum is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>p</mi></math></p><p>The new value of kinetic energy is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>K</mi></math></p><p>Hence, the percentage increase in kinetic energy is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">K</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#39;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">K</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">K</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mi>K</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p></blockquote>",
